slides.content:
# Exclude Certain Elements

`:not(selector)` matches elements that do NOT match the selector inside.

```css
/* all paragraphs except those with class .intro */
p:not(.intro) { font-size: 14px; }

/* all list items except the last one */
li:not(:last-child) { margin-bottom: 5px; }
```
You can pass simple selectors (not combinators) inside `:not()`.
